如果你是要比對 BAK_20260625 跟現在的 BSA_SUB_CUST_FACT_Extension 的 PEPBitwiseCode 是否相同，我會建議直接用 FULL JOIN 去比較。

SELECT
    ISNULL(a.CustomerNo,b.CustomerNo) AS CustomerNo,
    a.PEPBitwiseCode AS Old_PEPBitwiseCode,
    b.PEPBitwiseCode AS New_PEPBitwiseCode
FROM
(
    SELECT
        x.CustomerNo,
        c.PEPBitwiseCode
    FROM VERIFY..BSA_SUB_CUST_FACT x
    JOIN Customer_Migrate_buffer y
        ON x.CustomerNo = y.CustomerNo
    JOIN BSA_SUB_CUST_FACT_Extension_BAK_20260625 c
        ON x.cif_KEY = c.cif_KEY
    WHERE c.PEPBitwiseCode <> '0'
) a
FULL JOIN
(
    SELECT
        x.CustomerNo,
        c.PEPBitwiseCode
    FROM VERIFY..BSA_SUB_CUST_FACT x
    JOIN Customer_Migrate_buffer y
        ON x.CustomerNo = y.CustomerNo
    JOIN BSA_SUB_CUST_FACT_Extension c
        ON x.cif_KEY = c.cif_KEY
    WHERE c.PEPBitwiseCode <> '0'
) b
ON a.CustomerNo = b.CustomerNo
WHERE ISNULL(a.PEPBitwiseCode,-1) <> ISNULL(b.PEPBitwiseCode,-1);

如果你只想看不一樣的 Customer

結果會長這樣：

CustomerNo	Old	New
A001	2	18
A002	32	NULL
A003	NULL	64

代表：

* 2 →18 表示值被修改了
* 32 → NULL 表示舊的有，新的沒有
* NULL →64 表示新的多出來了

⸻

如果你還想知道到底是哪個 Bit 被改掉，可以更進一步拆開：

WITH OLD_DATA AS
(
    SELECT
        a.CustomerNo,
        c.PEPBitwiseCode
    FROM VERIFY..BSA_SUB_CUST_FACT a
    JOIN Customer_Migrate_buffer b
        ON a.CustomerNo = b.CustomerNo
    JOIN BSA_SUB_CUST_FACT_Extension_BAK_20260625 c
        ON a.cif_KEY = c.cif_KEY
),
NEW_DATA AS
(
    SELECT
        a.CustomerNo,
        c.PEPBitwiseCode
    FROM VERIFY..BSA_SUB_CUST_FACT a
    JOIN Customer_Migrate_buffer b
        ON a.CustomerNo = b.CustomerNo
    JOIN BSA_SUB_CUST_FACT_Extension c
        ON a.cif_KEY = c.cif_KEY
)
SELECT
    ISNULL(o.CustomerNo,n.CustomerNo) AS CustomerNo,
    o.PEPBitwiseCode AS Old_Code,
    n.PEPBitwiseCode AS New_Code,
    CASE WHEN o.PEPBitwiseCode & 2 = 2 THEN 'Y' ELSE 'N' END AS Old_PEP,
    CASE WHEN n.PEPBitwiseCode & 2 = 2 THEN 'Y' ELSE 'N' END AS New_PEP,
    CASE WHEN o.PEPBitwiseCode & 8 = 8 THEN 'Y' ELSE 'N' END AS Old_ForeignPEP,
    CASE WHEN n.PEPBitwiseCode & 8 = 8 THEN 'Y' ELSE 'N' END AS New_ForeignPEP,
    CASE WHEN o.PEPBitwiseCode & 16 = 16 THEN 'Y' ELSE 'N' END AS Old_LocalPEP,
    CASE WHEN n.PEPBitwiseCode & 16 = 16 THEN 'Y' ELSE 'N' END AS New_LocalPEP
FROM OLD_DATA o
FULL JOIN NEW_DATA n
    ON o.CustomerNo = n.CustomerNo
WHERE ISNULL(o.PEPBitwiseCode,-1)
    <> ISNULL(n.PEPBitwiseCode,-1);

例如：

CustomerNo	Old	New	Old_PEP	New_PEP	Old_Local	New_Local
123456	2	18	Y	Y	N	Y

你就可以很快知道：

* 舊資料 = 2 (00000010)
* 新資料 = 18 (00010010)
* PEP 沒變
* 多了一個 LocalPEP

如果只是驗證 migration 的結果，我會比較推薦第二種寫法，因為不只知道 Code 不一樣，還能立即知道是哪一個 Flag 被打開或關閉，做 SIT/UAT 時會方便很多。